  plain-text="## Two cafés near the station\n\n**Kahve Durağı** is the closest, two minutes on foot.[1] It opens at 7 and has seats outside.\n\n[2 images: Kahve Durağı, inside and out]\n\n**Liman Kahvesi** is quieter, with a view of the ferry pier.[1]\n\n[map: 0 places]\n\nLiman Kahvesi menu (https://limankahvesi.example/menu)"
